# Rewritten Text

In accordance with one embodiment of the present disclosure, a method is provided that enables an advertisement server, which is linked to a user device, to deliver advertisements via an advertising application installed on that device. This method includes the following steps:

**(a)** Detecting an activation signal transmitted from the user device, which serves as a request to switch the user device's screen from an inactive (off) state to an active (on) state;

**(b)** Displaying the advertisement on the screen in response to the received activation signal;

**(c)** Capturing a subsequent signal from the same user device—one that had previously displayed the advertisement—requesting access to the advertisement's associated content;

**(d)** Upon receipt of this content-request signal, transmitting the corresponding advertisement content to the user device; and

**(e)** Accumulating two distinct types of rewards for the user device: an initial reward tied to the activation signal, and a subsequent reward tied to the content-request signal.
